@model MiniStore.Application.Dtos.Settings.PurchaseMatchingSettingsDto
@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Localization.IStringLocalizer<MiniStore.Web.SharedResource> Localizer
@{ ViewData["Title"] = Localizer["Purchase matching"]; }
<div class="container mt-4">
    <h2>@Localizer["Purchase matching"]</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">@Localizer["Configure the allowed differences between purchase orders, goods receipts and vendor bills."]</p>
    <form asp-action="PurchaseMatching" method="post">
        <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="text-danger"></div>
        <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-md-6"><label asp-for="QuantityTolerancePercent" class="form-label">@Localizer["Quantity tolerance percent"]</label><input asp-for="QuantityTolerancePercent" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.0001" class="form-control" /></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label asp-for="PriceTolerancePercent" class="form-label">@Localizer["Price tolerance percent"]</label><input asp-for="PriceTolerancePercent" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.0001" class="form-control" /></div>
        </div>
        <div class="alert alert-info mt-3">@Localizer["Differences above these limits require the vendor bill match override permission and a reason."]</div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary">@Localizer["Save"]</button> <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">@Localizer["Back"]</a>
    </form>
</div>
